        "id": "9c67d7c99d35ce1cb2db2bfe"
      },
      "index": 0,
      "text": "We're about done here but before we go, does anyone has an idea of what was that whole story about Robert MacLeod calling us 'Kurgan'?\n\nSomehow I doubt that [[DM.Factions[faction_NorthwindHighlanders],Highlanders]] will ever explain that to us after we return the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreSwordClaymore],claymore]] to them.",
