    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c4d297b9b4e34f314e9ffcb"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Look, all I know is that this Robert MacLeod went mad and did something very wrong, besides just stealing the regimental claymore.\n\nAs to what exactly he did... all the Highlanders would remain silent on that specific issue.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb8caa3ede78324ec870fba"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ca2dc566a7722f542fbd626"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "The only reference I could find in the databases was that 'Kurgan' was once a Terran culture before the age of spaceflight.\n\nAs to the subject someone being immortal or becoming immortal by beheading another person, that seems to be Mr. Virtahen's speciality lately.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ce504276589132f914f1248"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ca16468eee823c524f352f2"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Hey, I'm trying to be serious here, Dr. Murad.\n\nMacLeod was who clearly had some sort of mental issue by declaring himself to the be 'one' and waiting for twenty years for someone to come and take their head.\n\n",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Thank you, Yang. What about our new 'Mech?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cbcea13a33f4891ce19ca6e"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c2b237c6b13b8d311e2b065"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "We're getting it fixed and cleaned up, the old lady apparently must have been sitting secretly in storage by Clan MacLeod since the end of the Star League.\n\nThe best part of the Highlander is the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreGaussRifle],Gauss]] Rifle it is carrying but we'll need to be careful because its is an unique and irreplaceable piece of [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreLosTech],LosTech]].",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ca5f3ea8773d09a79b191eb"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cd97bbad0ff7684771658c1"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "I'd say it might even be possible that this machine served in the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreRoyalBlackWatchRegiment],Black Watch]] although they tended to use the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreRoyal],Royal]] HGN-732b variant instead, which had improved heat sinks, now also lostech.\n\nEither way, it will serve us nicely if we keep it or if we sell it.  And with a special paint job, it might even pass as a former Black Watch 'Mech to a potential buyer.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Sounds very interesting or lucrative.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ce3819f9074ee9fe840a37a"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c4f5ce1c0efa9df2ae2b556"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "What that selling gimmick won't change is that we are very limited in our choice of contracts and I am afraid we will have to return to the Periphery soon.\n\nUntil then, let's get some rest people, great work.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c4a9ae0302be0916b2f3e00"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
